# IMPL-PERM_REPORT_FORMATTER essence pseudocode

<!-- [IMPL-PERM_REPORT_FORMATTER] [ARCH-MACOS_PERM_REPORT] [REQ-MACOS_PERM_REPORT] — structured JSON v1 and table output -->

## BUILD_REPORT

```
INPUT: rows[], catalog entries[], warnings[], resolveNames flag
OUTPUT: PermissionReport
POST: permissions grouped by alias; each grant includes client, clientType, displayName, authValue, status, lastModified
EFFECTS: status derived from authValue (2=granted, 0=denied, else unknown)
```

## EMIT_JSON_V1

```
INPUT: PermissionReport
OUTPUT: stdout string
POST: schemaVersion = 1; includes generatedAt, platform darwin, warnings[], permissions[]
EFFECTS: writes to stdout only
```

## EMIT_TABLE

```
INPUT: PermissionReport
OUTPUT: stdout string; diagnostics to stderr when warnings present
POST: human-readable sections per permission alias with columns client, displayName, status
```
